{"id":"28759558fc02662a","group":"58","path":"58/batch15/58-df-zfc-logic9-barwise-compactness.md","title":"ZFC Logic9 Barwise Compactness","display":"df-zfc-logic9-barwise-compactness — ZFC Logic9 Barwise Compactness","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-logic9-barwise-compactness","aliases":["58-df-zfc-logic9-barwise-compactness"],"display":"df-zfc-logic9-barwise-compactness — ZFC Logic9 Barwise Compactness","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-zfc-logic9-admissible-set]]","[[58-df-zfc-card6-countable-set]]","[[58-df-zfc-logic9-admissible-fragment]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-logic9-barwise-compactness"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-logic9-barwise-compactness</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-logic9-barwise-compactness — ZFC Logic9 Barwise Compactness"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4cbfb5925afe7f86\" href=\"?note=4cbfb5925afe7f86\" title=\"58-df-zfc-logic9-admissible-set\">58-df-zfc-logic9-admissible-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f02ce1cb4d0ec8b0\" href=\"?note=f02ce1cb4d0ec8b0\" title=\"58-df-zfc-card6-countable-set\">58-df-zfc-card6-countable-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5260365ec2a618b9\" href=\"?note=5260365ec2a618b9\" title=\"58-df-zfc-logic9-admissible-fragment\">58-df-zfc-logic9-admissible-fragment</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> is a countable admissible set, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\\in A\">\\(L\\in A\\)</span> is a set-coded signature, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> is a possibly external theory in the admissible fragment.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcLogic9AdmissibleSet}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcLogic9AdmissibleSet}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcCard6CountableSet}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcCard6CountableSet}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SigmaOneTheoryOver}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{SigmaOneTheoryOver}_S\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AdmissiblySatisfiable}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{AdmissiblySatisfiable}_S\\)</span> are supplied by the dependencies.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcLogic9BarwiseCompactness}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcLogic9BarwiseCompactness}_S\\)</span> is the property defined here.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}logic9\\text{-}barwise\\text{-}compactness}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcLogic9BarwiseCompactness}_S(A)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{ZfcLogic9AdmissibleSet}_S(A)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcCard6CountableSet}_S(A)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall L\\in A\\;\\forall T\\;\\left(\n\\mathrm{SigmaOneTheoryOver}_S(T,A,L)\\land\n\\forall T_0\\in A\\;\\left(T_0\\subseteq T\\to\\mathrm{AdmissiblySatisfiable}_S(T_0,A,L)\\right)\n\\to\\mathrm{AdmissiblySatisfiable}_S(T,A,L)\\right)\n\\end{aligned}\\right]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}logic9\\text{-}barwise\\text{-}compactness}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcLogic9BarwiseCompactness}_S(A)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{ZfcLogic9AdmissibleSet}_S(A)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcCard6CountableSet}_S(A)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall L\\in A\\;\\forall T\\;\\left(\n\\mathrm{SigmaOneTheoryOver}_S(T,A,L)\\land\n\\forall T_0\\in A\\;\\left(T_0\\subseteq T\\to\\mathrm{AdmissiblySatisfiable}_S(T_0,A,L)\\right)\n\\to\\mathrm{AdmissiblySatisfiable}_S(T,A,L)\\right)\n\\end{aligned}\\right]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}logic9\\text{-}barwise\\text{-}compactness}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcLogic9AdmissibleSet}_S(A)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcCard6CountableSet}_S(A)\n\\to\\mathrm{ZfcLogic9BarwiseCompactness}_S(A)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}logic9\\text{-}barwise\\text{-}compactness}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcLogic9AdmissibleSet}_S(A)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcCard6CountableSet}_S(A)\n\\to\\mathrm{ZfcLogic9BarwiseCompactness}_S(A)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The local hypotheses range over all <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>-finite subtheories, namely all <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_0\\in A\">\\(T_0\\in A\\)</span> with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_0\\subseteq T\">\\(T_0\\subseteq T\\)</span>; they are not restricted to externally finite sets.</li>\n<li>The theory <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> may be external to <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>, but must be <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1\">\\(\\Sigma_1\\)</span> over <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> and consist of sentences in the admissible infinitary fragment.</li>\n<li>The second assertion is the Barwise compactness theorem for countable admissible sets.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Barwise, Admissible Sets and Structures, Chapter III, Section 5</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-logic9-admissible-set","status":"resolved","id":"4cbfb5925afe7f86","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-logic9-admissible-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-card6-countable-set","status":"resolved","id":"f02ce1cb4d0ec8b0","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-card6-countable-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-logic9-admissible-fragment","status":"resolved","id":"5260365ec2a618b9","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-logic9-admissible-fragment]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"L\\in A","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcLogic9AdmissibleSet}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcCard6CountableSet}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SigmaOneTheoryOver}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{AdmissiblySatisfiable}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcLogic9BarwiseCompactness}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}logic9\\text{-}barwise\\text{-}compactness}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcLogic9BarwiseCompactness}_S(A)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left[\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{ZfcLogic9AdmissibleSet}_S(A)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcCard6CountableSet}_S(A)\\\\\n&{}\\land\\forall L\\in A\\;\\forall T\\;\\left(\n\\mathrm{SigmaOneTheoryOver}_S(T,A,L)\\land\n\\forall T_0\\in A\\;\\left(T_0\\subseteq T\\to\\mathrm{AdmissiblySatisfiable}_S(T_0,A,L)\\right)\n\\to\\mathrm{AdmissiblySatisfiable}_S(T,A,L)\\right)\n\\end{aligned}\\right]","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}logic9\\text{-}barwise\\text{-}compactness}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcLogic9AdmissibleSet}_S(A)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcCard6CountableSet}_S(A)\n\\to\\mathrm{ZfcLogic9BarwiseCompactness}_S(A)","display":true},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"T_0\\in A","display":false},{"tex":"T_0\\subseteq T","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_1","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false}],"bytes":2060,"backlinks":[{"id":"a11585cba9c21cfd","anchor":"ref-281","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-logic9-barwise-compactness]]"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2487","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-zfc-logic9-barwise-compactness.md|58-df-zfc-logic9-barwise-compactness]]（batch15）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","4cbfb5925afe7f86","f02ce1cb4d0ec8b0","5260365ec2a618b9"]}